  "details": "For those that dip out of the main area of the 'community labs' upon publishing and the 'recently updated', there should be better promotional tools such as a creator spotlight in a high traffic area of VRC. Whether it's on the worlds search area or a static area on the side of the hub, it's incredibly hard to be seen after a few minutes.\n\nEligibility factors:\n- Users have a rank minimum to enter spotlight (so spam worlds/users don't clutter it)\n- World must be under a certain size and/or optimized\n- Only 1 world allowed per week per user\n- Must be a VRC+ user. This would be to reduce clutter/spam + give another reason for the subscription.",
